!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = RNA was column-extracted using Rneasy Fibrous Tissue Mini kit (skM) and Rneasy Lipid Tissue Mini Kit (fat) (Qiagen)
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = RNA-seq libraries were prepared from 100-200 ng high-quality RNA using TruSeq RNA Library Prep Kit v2 (Illumina)
