!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = tissue: gastrocnemius muscle
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = age: 8-10 months
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = genotype: HH
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = background strain: 129Sve/C57BL/6 mix
!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = Skeletal muscle (skM, gastrocnemius) and fat (IAT) from 8-10-month-old wildtype and progeroid BubR1 MVA mutant mice (BubR1H/L1002P and BubR1H/H) were collected and harvested from naturally aged mice, euthanized at 8-10 months of age. RNA was extracted from tissues and was used for RNA sequencing.
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = total RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = RNA was column-extracted using Rneasy Fibrous Tissue Mini kit (skM) and Rneasy Lipid Tissue Mini Kit (fat) (Qiagen)
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = RNA-seq libraries were prepared from 100-200 ng high-quality RNA using TruSeq RNA Library Prep Kit v2 (Illumina)
!Sample_data_processing = Fastq files of pair-end RNA-Seq reads were aligned with Tophat 2.0.14  to the reference genome UCSC mm10 using Bowtie2 2.2.6 with default parameters.
!Sample_data_processing = Gene level counts were obtained using featureCounts 1.4.6 from the subRead package with gene models from corresponding UCSC annotation packages.
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: mm10
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: raw counts in tab-delimited text file
